## Proof Pull
Treat random031's hard pair as a forbidden seam, not a wall to cross.
The complement carries all q=14V phase flow; the max-delta seam carries
the seven-owner gluing charge but receives zero compatible phase hits.
The only phase contact with the seam components is the lower-delta
mirror bypass, exactly 6 hits on each side.  A useful named clause
should therefore glue: mirror-punctured cylinder + seven-owner seam
+ lower-delta bypass + C=27 carry/doubling split.
